    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII guard that activates a span scope and restores the previous context and span on destruction (including on exception paths). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by TRACE_SCOPE_* macros to guarantee correct nesting — without this guard the thread-local context would be left pointing at a destroyed span after the scope exits. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
